  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1223199,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1497: Five Years After - A Commodore Amiga Classic\n\nStep into the boots of a daring captain in *1497: Five Years After*, a captivating strategy game for the Commodore Amiga! Set five years after the initial discovery of the New World, you’re tasked by your King to explore, colonize, and ultimately dominate the uncharted territories. \n\nCommand your cargo ship and embark on a perilous journey to eradicate rival European powers vying for control of this lucrative land.  Build thriving settlements, manage resources, and strategically deploy your forces to overcome challenges and expand your empire.  \n\n*1497* blends elements of Colonization and Civilization, offering a deep and rewarding gameplay experience.  Careful planning and shrewd diplomacy are essential for survival.  Will you forge a lasting legacy, or succumb to the dangers of the New World?  Prepare for a thrilling adventure filled with exploration, conquest, and the struggle for dominance!"
    },
